WEBVTT

01:31.640 --> 01:32.700
=The Road to Splendor=

01:32.700 --> 01:34.760
(Adapted from China Literature author
Zhizhi's novel of the same name)

01:35.320 --> 01:38.000
=Episode 17=

01:38.160 --> 01:39.640
Why did you falsify the records?

01:41.120 --> 01:42.400
Why did you claim Lu Dahu's merits

01:42.680 --> 01:44.040
under the brothers' names?

01:48.319 --> 01:50.000
Yucheng, why did you do it?

01:57.280 --> 01:57.920
Answer me.

02:01.319 --> 02:03.280
Doesn't this happen all the time
in the army?

02:03.920 --> 02:04.959
I'm asking about you.

02:08.039 --> 02:08.960
Yang Yucheng.

02:09.759 --> 02:10.479
Why

02:12.960 --> 02:14.120
did you do this?

02:18.199 --> 02:18.719
Fine.

02:20.520 --> 02:22.479
Then let me ask you something, Mr. Zhao.

02:23.400 --> 02:24.039
Why

02:26.199 --> 02:29.039
shouldn't I do it?

02:31.960 --> 02:33.759
Those singers in the pleasure houses...

02:34.719 --> 02:36.360
all they have to do is humble themselves

02:36.360 --> 02:38.000
and smile for the officials,

02:38.520 --> 02:40.759
and their pockets fill with gold.

02:40.840 --> 02:43.439
Those who act as attack dogs
for powerful families

02:44.360 --> 02:46.439
may rip out a few throats,

02:46.520 --> 02:48.319
fawn on their masters
with wagging tails,

02:48.599 --> 02:50.599
and still climb the ranks.

02:51.000 --> 02:52.080
If everyone else can do it,

02:52.800 --> 02:54.240
why can't we?

02:58.919 --> 03:00.560
The men came all the way out here

03:00.560 --> 03:01.520
to serve in the army.

03:01.520 --> 03:02.280
What for?

03:03.000 --> 03:03.800
Wasn't it so they could

03:03.800 --> 03:04.639
take the heads of enemies

03:04.639 --> 03:05.599
and bandits

03:05.599 --> 03:06.479
and earn military merit?

03:07.120 --> 03:08.000
And what did they get?

03:08.599 --> 03:09.360
No grain.

03:09.360 --> 03:10.000
No salt.

03:10.000 --> 03:11.919
Not even the merit
we'd rightfully earned.

03:11.919 --> 03:12.719
How is that fair?

03:13.439 --> 03:14.879
Now I've found a way

03:15.039 --> 03:16.479
to set all that injustice

03:16.479 --> 03:17.360
right.

03:17.360 --> 03:19.080
Why shouldn't we take it?

03:23.319 --> 03:24.120
Lately,

03:25.840 --> 03:27.039
I keep thinking about

03:27.840 --> 03:29.639
when we were salt smugglers.

03:32.840 --> 03:33.800
One job,

03:33.800 --> 03:35.000
one payment.

03:35.800 --> 03:37.199
Sure, we lived outside the law,

03:37.960 --> 03:38.919
but we were free

03:39.039 --> 03:39.680
to live as we pleased.

03:42.400 --> 03:43.400
But now?

03:46.280 --> 03:47.199
Look at us now.

03:51.120 --> 03:52.800
We always do the right thing,

03:53.439 --> 03:55.599
and somehow we're the ones
with our hands tied.

03:58.039 --> 03:59.159
If that's what it means

04:00.080 --> 04:01.319
to be an honorable man,

04:04.479 --> 04:05.439
then I'd rather be a villain.

04:19.399 --> 04:20.079
Mr. Zhao,

04:20.600 --> 04:21.839
I've said my piece.

04:22.240 --> 04:23.800
Beat me or punish me. I'll take it.

04:24.319 --> 04:25.399
But when there's a shortcut,

04:25.399 --> 04:26.519
everyone wants to take it.

04:29.399 --> 04:30.319
I'm begging you.

04:32.000 --> 04:33.199
Take the easy way just once.

04:33.920 --> 04:35.040
Bend the knee just once.

04:35.839 --> 04:36.560
Just once.

04:44.639 --> 04:45.120
Yucheng,

04:45.120 --> 04:46.839
when you worked as muscle
for those bandits,

04:48.480 --> 04:50.040
did you ever take an innocent life?

04:54.959 --> 04:56.319
There are lines we can cross.

04:56.759 --> 04:58.079
But there are some

05:00.720 --> 05:02.240
we never can.

05:04.560 --> 05:05.279
Yucheng,

05:06.439 --> 05:08.120
do you want a moment of glory,

05:09.680 --> 05:11.480
or a lifetime with a clear conscience?

05:14.600 --> 05:15.199
Fine.

05:16.160 --> 05:18.279
The men and I can put up
with the hardship.

05:18.439 --> 05:19.279
But what about Miss Xie?

05:20.040 --> 05:21.920
Are you willing to make her suffer
with you for the rest of her life?

05:21.920 --> 05:23.160
We still have a long road ahead.

05:23.160 --> 05:23.720
Why rush?

05:23.720 --> 05:25.560
You have a long road ahead.

05:28.000 --> 05:28.720
What about my mother?

05:31.600 --> 05:32.959
How much time does she have left?

06:13.879 --> 06:15.439
(For Fifth Madam Fu, the Capital)
The post station sent

06:16.160 --> 06:17.920
all your letters back.

06:19.040 --> 06:20.720
They said they're short-staffed,

06:20.959 --> 06:23.000
so they won't be delivering letters
to the capital anymore.

06:23.879 --> 06:24.759
They also said...

06:25.439 --> 06:26.319
What did they say?

06:28.160 --> 06:29.160
They said

06:29.399 --> 06:31.360
you could try asking for a favor,

06:31.480 --> 06:33.360
but you'd better ask the right person.

06:34.000 --> 06:35.079
It made me wonder

06:35.399 --> 06:37.120
if someone specifically ordered them

06:37.120 --> 06:38.319
not to deliver our letters.

06:40.959 --> 06:42.439
I think I know who it is.

06:43.639 --> 06:44.800
Yu Jingxiu.

06:49.759 --> 06:50.639
No.

06:50.879 --> 06:52.959
That's your favorite hairpin.

06:53.720 --> 06:54.839
You can't pawn it.

06:55.399 --> 06:56.759
I'll go ask Mr. Zhao.

06:57.639 --> 06:59.199
He is already upset.

06:59.360 --> 07:01.319
Don't burden him with this too.

07:08.160 --> 07:08.959
Sanniang,

07:09.399 --> 07:10.199
could you

07:10.199 --> 07:11.639
make another trip to the post station
for me?

07:15.080 --> 07:17.080
(Zhao Residence)

07:19.839 --> 07:21.199
There'll be other chances.

07:22.079 --> 07:23.079
What matters most

07:24.800 --> 07:26.480
is that you don't lose your drive.

07:33.600 --> 07:34.279
Don't worry.

07:35.519 --> 07:36.800
I'm no hothead anymore.

07:39.279 --> 07:40.040
I can be patient.

07:50.720 --> 07:51.639
Mr. Zhao, I...

07:56.519 --> 07:57.639
You already know?

07:58.040 --> 07:59.399
If it's something you treasure most,

08:00.560 --> 08:01.680
you should keep it.

08:22.240 --> 08:23.680
I still have some personal savings.

08:24.120 --> 08:25.160
I had Zheng San

08:26.120 --> 08:27.439
give it to a courier
at the post station.

08:28.160 --> 08:29.759
Hopefully, the money will persuade him

08:30.959 --> 08:31.959
to make the trip for you.

08:52.639 --> 08:53.559
I'm not in a hurry.

08:54.120 --> 08:54.879
Mr. Zhao,

08:55.600 --> 08:57.200
you don't need to rush either.

08:58.320 --> 08:59.000
There will always be

08:59.559 --> 09:00.799
another chance.

09:11.679 --> 09:12.279
Mr. Zhao.

09:20.039 --> 09:21.039
Did the letter get sent?

09:22.200 --> 09:23.320
They returned the money.

09:55.399 --> 09:56.799
(Just one rank above you,)

09:57.039 --> 09:58.200
(and I can crush you.)

10:00.360 --> 10:02.399
(Ganlin Town is like a swamp.)

10:02.399 --> 10:04.960
(You have to walk over corpses
to carve a path forward.)

10:05.120 --> 10:06.720
(Ten lifetimes won't be enough
to get ahead.)

10:06.720 --> 10:07.559
(Want to turn things around?)

10:08.519 --> 10:09.360
(That's a bit difficult.)

10:09.559 --> 10:12.080
(But the inspector
has flagged your record.)

10:12.240 --> 10:14.320
(If you can't get past this yourself,)

10:14.879 --> 10:16.440
(there's nothing I can do for you.)

10:21.759 --> 10:23.919
(She was born a lady of a noble house.)

10:24.519 --> 10:26.159
(Now she wears rough clothes
and eats plain food,)

10:26.600 --> 10:28.519
(her hands scarred from hard labor,)

10:28.519 --> 10:30.480
(no different from the farm women
of Ganlin.)

10:32.159 --> 10:32.960
(Why)

10:33.960 --> 10:35.519
(would you let a jewel like her
be buried in the dust?)

10:36.040 --> 10:41.640
♪The wind howls,
yet never chills my soul♪

10:41.640 --> 10:47.240
♪War drums resound across the vast sky♪

10:50.799 --> 10:51.639
(But what about Miss Xie?)

10:52.080 --> 10:54.159
(Are you willing to make her suffer
with you for the rest of her life?)

10:54.279 --> 10:55.759
(Now I've found a way)

10:55.919 --> 10:57.360
(to set all that injustice)

10:57.360 --> 10:58.240
(right.)

10:58.240 --> 11:00.039
(Why shouldn't we take it?)

11:03.440 --> 11:10.400
♪Looking back, this life was a song♪

11:13.080 --> 11:14.919
Your subordinate, Banner Commander Yang,

11:14.919 --> 11:17.000
is credited with killing 36 bandits.

11:17.360 --> 11:19.480
Today, according to the military
merit record,

11:19.480 --> 11:20.919
we're conducting a second verification.

11:21.480 --> 11:22.320
Commander Zhao,

11:23.080 --> 11:24.240
is this military merit

11:25.320 --> 11:26.360
genuine?

11:49.559 --> 11:50.720
My Lord,

11:54.279 --> 11:55.360
this record...

12:08.919 --> 12:10.120
is accurate.

12:10.799 --> 12:11.360
Alright.

12:11.600 --> 12:12.679
If it's accurate,

12:12.960 --> 12:14.600
then countersign

12:14.720 --> 12:15.720
the military merit record.

12:24.080 --> 12:27.000
(Zhao Ling)

12:42.559 --> 12:43.440
Miss Xie!

12:43.960 --> 12:44.600
Miss Xie!

12:44.840 --> 12:46.000
Word just came from the army.

12:46.120 --> 12:47.279
Mr. Zhao's military merit

12:47.399 --> 12:48.440
has been approved!

12:48.840 --> 12:49.720
Before long,

12:49.720 --> 12:51.320
he'll be made battalion commander.

12:51.399 --> 12:52.600
Battalion commander!

12:52.840 --> 12:53.559
Really?

12:53.799 --> 12:54.799
Really.

12:55.279 --> 12:57.039
We can go back to the capital!

12:58.480 --> 12:59.720
I'll go make something tasty.

12:59.919 --> 13:00.360
I'll go.

13:00.360 --> 13:00.840
Okay.

13:10.639 --> 13:11.440
Mother...

13:12.519 --> 13:13.879
I can come back to the capital.

13:17.080 --> 13:19.120
I can finally come home.

13:42.919 --> 13:44.000
Mr. Zhao, you're back.

13:49.000 --> 13:50.360
This is wonderful.

13:50.679 --> 13:52.240
We can finally go back to the capital.

13:53.000 --> 13:54.639
I can finally be reunited with Mother.

13:56.320 --> 13:57.039
Back then,

13:57.960 --> 13:59.159
I promised your mother

13:59.799 --> 14:01.360
I'd get you safely back to the capital.

14:04.200 --> 14:05.679
I never expected all these twists
and turns

14:08.200 --> 14:09.360
to delay us for so long.

14:10.159 --> 14:11.799
I wouldn't call it a delay.

14:12.080 --> 14:14.120
Mother only asked you to take me back
to the capital.

14:14.480 --> 14:15.919
I was the one who thought

14:15.919 --> 14:17.120
there might be another way to get there.

14:17.399 --> 14:19.559
And you stayed with me
through the hardest path of all.

14:41.399 --> 14:43.000
Once we're safely back in the capital,

14:44.080 --> 14:45.320
I'll visit your family in person

14:46.480 --> 14:47.679
and complete all the proper
betrothal rites.

14:48.679 --> 14:49.799
I only hope

14:51.000 --> 14:52.840
your mother will forgive
my earlier disrespect.

14:55.679 --> 14:57.039
She'll like you.

15:00.039 --> 15:01.080
And then,

15:01.399 --> 15:02.919
just as we promised

15:02.919 --> 15:03.960
back in Yongning.

15:05.720 --> 15:06.919
We'll stand together in what is right

15:09.919 --> 15:11.159
and trust each other with our lives.

15:29.720 --> 15:31.240
For these three-grain buns,

15:31.320 --> 15:33.000
steam at least twenty baskets
in advance.

15:33.240 --> 15:34.360
Between each layer,

15:34.360 --> 15:36.159
pack plenty of pepper-and-salt
cured meat.

15:36.360 --> 15:37.240
Otherwise,

15:37.240 --> 15:38.159
we won't have enough for the journey.

15:38.519 --> 15:39.440
Yes, Miss Xie.

15:39.440 --> 15:40.360
Don't worry.

15:40.799 --> 15:41.879
That'll be more than enough.

15:41.879 --> 15:42.320
Miss Xie,

15:42.679 --> 15:43.440
we found

15:43.440 --> 15:44.639
six sacks of millet in the storeroom.

15:44.759 --> 15:45.919
I'll go to the market now

15:45.919 --> 15:46.840
and have it ground into flour.

15:47.519 --> 15:49.080
Keep three sacks each of grain
and flour.

15:49.639 --> 15:51.200
Then go to the market

15:51.200 --> 15:53.080
and have all the mules and horses fitted
with double horseshoes.

15:53.200 --> 15:54.320
Also, buy

15:54.759 --> 15:56.120
20 tanned-leather waterskins,

15:56.120 --> 15:57.559
along with fire starters and tung oil.

15:57.679 --> 15:59.360
Dozens of men burn
through supplies fast.

15:59.360 --> 16:00.639
Don't wait until we run short
on the road

16:00.639 --> 16:02.279
and have to scramble everywhere
for more.

16:02.519 --> 16:03.039
Okay.

16:18.159 --> 16:19.120
Take this with you.

16:19.399 --> 16:20.279
It's a long journey,

16:20.559 --> 16:21.639
and it'll only get colder as you travel.

16:21.879 --> 16:23.000
You'll definitely need the extra layer.

16:34.000 --> 16:35.320
(But there are some)

16:35.799 --> 16:37.360
(we never can.)

16:38.200 --> 16:38.960
(Yucheng,)

16:39.399 --> 16:41.120
(do you want a moment of glory,)

16:42.879 --> 16:44.679
(or a lifetime with a clear conscience?)

17:07.319 --> 17:09.400
(Chiyu Post Station)
They murdered innocent people!

17:09.640 --> 17:12.599
Please, My Lord,

17:12.920 --> 17:16.160
give us justice!

17:17.240 --> 17:17.960
Commander Wang,

17:18.720 --> 17:19.720
the victim's family claims

17:20.440 --> 17:22.000
Zhao Ling was involved.

17:22.519 --> 17:23.559
You there.

17:24.240 --> 17:26.720
How can you be sure the man
was Zhao Ling?

17:27.160 --> 17:28.799
I was too far away that day.

17:29.119 --> 17:29.920
But I vaguely

17:29.920 --> 17:32.200
heard his men and soldiers

17:32.279 --> 17:33.480
calling him Mr. Zhao.

17:36.400 --> 17:37.160
Well...

17:37.640 --> 17:39.559
according to the military merit records,

17:40.480 --> 17:41.960
the unit escorting the supplies that day

17:42.839 --> 17:44.720
was indeed Zhao Ling's.

17:46.600 --> 17:49.280
(Yang Yucheng; Zhao Ling)

17:50.640 --> 17:51.839
(Garrison Military Merit Record)

17:51.839 --> 17:52.920
Zhao Ling

17:53.359 --> 17:55.599
is a soldier I personally trained
and promoted.

17:56.000 --> 17:57.359
I don't believe

17:57.359 --> 18:00.319
he'd murder civilians and claim them
as military kills.

18:00.480 --> 18:01.119
Commander Wang,

18:01.759 --> 18:03.480
Zhao Ling is your subordinate.

18:03.759 --> 18:04.440
By law,

18:05.279 --> 18:06.440
you should recuse yourself.

18:06.799 --> 18:07.759
Why don't you leave this case

18:08.279 --> 18:09.680
to us?

18:20.119 --> 18:21.000
(Official Document)
You're accused

18:21.079 --> 18:21.960
of killing civilians for merit.

18:22.480 --> 18:23.359
Come with us.

18:26.519 --> 18:27.400
Miss Xie!

18:29.039 --> 18:29.720
Sis?

18:29.960 --> 18:31.680
Commander Zhao has been arrested.

18:32.079 --> 18:33.039
Someone reported him

18:33.039 --> 18:34.279
for killing civilians
and claiming military credit.

18:34.559 --> 18:35.359
That is a crime

18:35.359 --> 18:37.079
punishable by death.

18:39.839 --> 18:41.400
The Wangur people are attacking!

18:42.559 --> 18:43.880
The Wangur people are here!

18:52.200 --> 18:55.920
(Shaqiong Town Border)

18:58.880 --> 19:00.160
(Hall of Pacification)

19:00.160 --> 19:00.680
Sir.

19:04.279 --> 19:05.079
The Wangur people

19:05.079 --> 19:06.119
launched a surprise attack on Shaqiong.

19:06.279 --> 19:07.519
They breached the defenses

19:07.759 --> 19:09.000
and extinguished the beacon tower.

19:09.200 --> 19:10.759
By the time the six frontier towns
realized what had happened,

19:10.880 --> 19:12.519
Shaqiong had already fallen
to the enemy.

19:15.039 --> 19:15.880
Pass down my orders.

19:16.319 --> 19:17.880
Muster the troops
for battle immediately.

19:18.079 --> 19:19.240
All provisions and weapons

19:19.240 --> 19:20.920
must be ready by dawn tomorrow.

19:20.920 --> 19:23.400
They'll go with the advance force
to reinforce Shaqiong.

19:24.160 --> 19:24.799
Yes, sir.

19:25.960 --> 19:28.400
The evidence that you killed civilians
and claimed merit has been reported.

19:29.200 --> 19:30.759
There's no chance
of overturning the case now.

19:31.680 --> 19:33.720
All that's left is for you
to be beheaded.

19:35.440 --> 19:36.480
If you're after me,

19:38.000 --> 19:39.400
why drag innocent people into it?

19:41.880 --> 19:43.400
You can't even save yourself,

19:43.720 --> 19:45.160
and you're still trying
to protect others?

19:46.400 --> 19:47.519
The army has confirmed

19:47.599 --> 19:49.359
that your men killed 16 civilians

19:49.359 --> 19:50.720
and claimed them
as Wangur to earn merit.

19:51.000 --> 19:53.240
Those civilians didn't choose
to be branded as enemies.

19:53.480 --> 19:55.319
But your brothers are so loyal.

19:56.559 --> 19:58.039
Maybe they'd volunteer.

20:02.759 --> 20:03.799
What do you mean?

20:06.440 --> 20:08.079
It's only 16 heads.

20:08.079 --> 20:09.039
Easy enough.

20:09.680 --> 20:11.640
You've got plenty of brothers
who've risked their lives with you.

20:12.559 --> 20:13.480
Kill 16 of them

20:13.720 --> 20:14.440
and use their heads instead.

20:14.920 --> 20:16.039
Then you get to live.

20:16.440 --> 20:17.359
Otherwise,

20:17.519 --> 20:18.920
your entire unit

20:19.640 --> 20:22.039
won't even get the chance

20:22.039 --> 20:22.960
to fight at Shaqiong.

20:29.279 --> 20:30.559
The Wangur tribe has attacked
the frontier?

20:32.680 --> 20:34.680
Shaqiong has already fallen.

20:34.680 --> 20:36.279
The army is about to march out,

20:36.279 --> 20:37.119
while you

20:37.480 --> 20:38.799
will be stuck in here,

20:38.799 --> 20:40.720
without even making
the deployment roster.

20:40.880 --> 20:41.960
Yu Jingxiu!

20:42.640 --> 20:43.599
To go after me,

20:43.880 --> 20:44.880
you disregard the external threat.

20:44.880 --> 20:46.799
The Wangur attack on the pass
is a matter of national security.

20:47.519 --> 20:49.240
Aren't you afraid of delaying
critical military actions?

21:12.000 --> 21:14.759
You're nothing
but a lowborn former salt smuggler.

21:14.759 --> 21:17.079
Don't presume to lecture me
about affairs of state.

21:18.160 --> 21:20.119
You can use brute force
to seize a few warhorses,

21:20.720 --> 21:22.920
or use some street tricks
to win a lantern festival contest.

21:22.920 --> 21:24.119
But so what?

21:26.440 --> 21:27.720
You know nothing of military texts,

21:27.720 --> 21:28.680
nothing of strategy,

21:28.680 --> 21:30.079
and you've never killed an enemy
on the battlefield.

21:30.079 --> 21:31.200
All your military merit

21:31.200 --> 21:33.319
came from tricks and shortcuts.

21:34.480 --> 21:35.960
How far do you think that'll take you?

21:37.000 --> 21:38.759
You're the son of a high censor

21:39.400 --> 21:41.039
and the top scholar of your year.

21:41.240 --> 21:42.559
Yet you stoop to this.

21:43.160 --> 21:44.839
Aren't you afraid people will laugh
at you?

22:13.359 --> 22:14.759
No one will laugh at me.

22:16.000 --> 22:17.680
Everyone wants to be me.

22:18.440 --> 22:19.759
Don't you want to be me too?

22:20.519 --> 22:21.279
Otherwise,

22:22.480 --> 22:23.759
why did you sign

22:23.759 --> 22:25.480
that falsified military merit record?

22:27.000 --> 22:28.519
People are born into different stations.

22:29.720 --> 22:31.440
Some are highborn, others lowborn.

22:32.799 --> 22:34.599
If those at the bottom want to rise,

22:34.599 --> 22:36.519
they have to climb over others to do it,

22:36.519 --> 22:38.839
even if it costs them a piece
of themselves.

22:38.839 --> 22:40.920
For every man promoted,
another is demoted.

22:41.119 --> 22:43.160
For every man who prospers,
another suffers.

22:43.160 --> 22:43.920
Whenever one person gains,

22:43.920 --> 22:45.519
someone else has to lose.

22:46.480 --> 22:48.480
You want to reinvent yourself
and rise in the world?

22:48.480 --> 22:50.079
It's not that easy.

22:50.839 --> 22:52.440
You could spend ten years,

22:52.519 --> 22:53.759
even decades,

22:53.759 --> 22:55.799
and still never reach my father's level.

22:57.279 --> 22:59.279
This world has its phoenixes

23:00.839 --> 23:02.119
and its barren branches.

23:05.799 --> 23:07.319
(She was born a phoenix,)

23:08.079 --> 23:09.759
(yet she's perched on a barren branch.)

23:10.440 --> 23:12.160
(She believed you were
an honorable man.)

23:13.079 --> 23:13.880
(But look at you.)

23:15.039 --> 23:16.400
(The moment your own desires got
in the way,)

23:17.160 --> 23:19.039
(you became just as selfish
as anyone else.)

23:21.200 --> 23:21.960
(Zhao Ling.)

23:23.039 --> 23:25.200
(If you have any pride left as a man,)

23:25.680 --> 23:27.279
(then let her spread her wings and go.)

23:28.960 --> 23:30.960
(Don't waste the best years
of her life.)

23:37.359 --> 23:37.920
Madam,

23:38.079 --> 23:39.559
Zhao Ling has been framed.

23:40.039 --> 23:41.200
Please help us get justice.

23:41.200 --> 23:42.319
Let me see him.

23:42.759 --> 23:44.400
With war breaking out,

23:44.400 --> 23:45.960
Commander Wang simply can't get away
right now.

23:46.319 --> 23:48.599
And I certainly can't let you see
Zhao Ling without permission.

23:49.759 --> 23:50.920
You'll have to wait a little longer.

23:51.799 --> 23:52.680
Advisor Li!

23:54.880 --> 23:56.880
The army is about to march.

23:57.119 --> 23:58.960
Why haven't your military
supplies arrived?

23:59.839 --> 24:01.640
The soldiers are cold and hungry.

24:02.200 --> 24:03.920
How are they supposed to fight?

24:04.160 --> 24:05.000
Commander Wang,

24:05.680 --> 24:07.599
let's not talk as though
we've already lost.

24:07.759 --> 24:09.160
It's not that I'm withholding supplies.

24:09.359 --> 24:10.400
The truth is,

24:10.599 --> 24:11.480
the storehouses

24:11.559 --> 24:12.720
are empty.

24:14.599 --> 24:15.759
Advisor Li,

24:16.720 --> 24:18.240
if that's your answer,

24:19.000 --> 24:21.200
then I'll report this to His Majesty

24:21.200 --> 24:22.920
and ask him to investigate.

24:23.119 --> 24:24.559
We'll see whether someone

24:24.839 --> 24:26.559
has been lining his own pockets.

24:26.960 --> 24:27.680
Very well.

24:28.400 --> 24:29.319
Then you and I

24:29.960 --> 24:31.319
can both submit reports.

24:31.680 --> 24:33.240
Let the Censorate

24:33.519 --> 24:34.960
conduct a proper investigation

24:35.160 --> 24:37.200
into exactly who has been allowing

24:38.200 --> 24:39.759
the garrison

24:39.880 --> 24:40.720
to openly engage

24:41.160 --> 24:42.960
in the illegal salt trade.

24:44.200 --> 24:46.119
If you hadn't spent all these years

24:47.079 --> 24:48.759
skimming our military funds,

24:48.759 --> 24:50.480
why would I ever have needed

24:50.599 --> 24:52.319
to buy illegal salt from bandits?

24:52.480 --> 24:54.000
Skimming funds? Nonsense.

24:54.880 --> 24:55.759
Transport losses,

24:55.920 --> 24:56.680
and storage losses...

24:56.880 --> 24:58.119
every expense

24:58.119 --> 24:59.079
is clearly itemized

25:00.119 --> 25:01.920
in the account books.

25:02.319 --> 25:03.839
I've always been

25:03.839 --> 25:05.400
diligent in my duties

25:05.480 --> 25:06.240
and, as an official,

25:06.359 --> 25:08.039
completely aboveboard.

25:08.039 --> 25:08.480
You...

25:09.480 --> 25:10.279
Commander Wang,

25:11.160 --> 25:13.240
if you really want to take this
all the way,

25:13.759 --> 25:15.599
my life isn't worth much.

25:16.000 --> 25:17.279
I have nothing to fear from death.

25:17.440 --> 25:18.400
But we're different.

25:19.200 --> 25:20.359
War is about to begin.

25:20.440 --> 25:22.359
If His Majesty takes notice of this,

25:23.279 --> 25:24.599
one imperial decree

25:24.720 --> 25:26.480
could summon you back to the capital.

25:26.480 --> 25:27.160
And then,

25:27.759 --> 25:29.200
the army would be left
without a commander.

25:29.559 --> 25:30.200
You still couldn't

25:30.519 --> 25:31.759
fight the war.

25:42.440 --> 25:43.400
Ninth Young Lady, you're here.

25:43.640 --> 25:44.920
I, Fu Tingyun,

25:45.519 --> 25:47.559
have come regarding the false charges
against my fiance, Zhao Ling.

25:48.000 --> 25:49.799
I beg you to investigate
the matter fairly, Young Lord Yu.

25:50.240 --> 25:51.319
The charge against him

25:51.960 --> 25:53.119
is a complete fabrication.

25:55.839 --> 25:56.839
Do you have proof?

26:05.319 --> 26:06.480
The proof is right here.

26:06.480 --> 26:07.239
(Declarant: Yu Jingxiu)

26:07.839 --> 26:09.240
These four written confessions

26:09.480 --> 26:10.480
are enough to prove

26:11.319 --> 26:12.920
that you put Zuo Junjie up to

26:14.160 --> 26:15.480
falsely accusing me of adultery.

26:18.519 --> 26:19.960
You, the distinguished top scholar,

26:20.359 --> 26:21.680
broke your word
and backed out of the match,

26:21.960 --> 26:23.200
then went so far as
to frame a defenseless woman,

26:23.759 --> 26:25.319
all because you were
at odds with your mother.

26:25.319 --> 26:27.079
If this becomes public,

26:27.799 --> 26:29.319
your reputation will be ruined.

26:30.599 --> 26:32.079
Are you threatening me,
Ninth Young Lady?

26:34.799 --> 26:35.920
Do you think I'm afraid?

26:38.319 --> 26:39.799
If you're willing to show mercy

26:40.880 --> 26:41.880
and let Zhao Ling go,

26:42.680 --> 26:44.599
I'll let this matter go

26:44.839 --> 26:46.279
as though it never happened.

26:47.400 --> 26:48.440
From then on,

26:48.720 --> 26:50.119
we'll have

26:50.599 --> 26:51.519
nothing more

26:52.400 --> 26:53.400
to do with each other.

26:57.400 --> 26:58.799
(Declarant: Yu Jingxiu)
You went through so much

26:59.680 --> 27:01.880
to get these four written confessions.

27:08.039 --> 27:09.119
And now you're just giving them up?

27:18.440 --> 27:19.920
What is so special about Zhao Ling

27:20.599 --> 27:21.880
that you'd go this far for him?

28:08.240 --> 28:09.319
I've shown you my sincerity.

28:10.480 --> 28:11.880
I hope you'll accept it.

28:14.160 --> 28:15.160
Do you really think

28:17.119 --> 28:18.000
I did all this

28:18.000 --> 28:20.319
just to get these four confessions?

28:21.440 --> 28:22.799
Do you truly not know

28:22.799 --> 28:24.160
what it is I really want?

28:27.000 --> 28:28.960
Zhao Ling has no hope
of recovering from this.

28:31.160 --> 28:32.160
In family background,

28:32.160 --> 28:32.880
in talent...

28:32.880 --> 28:33.960
How can you say this to me?

28:35.039 --> 28:36.720
What about Fan Yake?

28:40.400 --> 28:41.480
I always believed

28:43.119 --> 28:44.160
marriage meant

28:45.359 --> 28:46.880
finding someone to walk beside you,

28:47.200 --> 28:49.279
never failing each other
as you rise together.

28:49.640 --> 28:50.920
But you've made me realize

28:51.319 --> 28:52.680
that even within marriage,

28:53.480 --> 28:54.960
a person can still be heartless.

28:57.839 --> 28:58.680
Yu Jingxiu.

29:00.319 --> 29:01.759
I already have someone I choose
to stand beside.

29:01.960 --> 29:04.160
I will never treat him as coldly
as you treat others.

29:09.640 --> 29:10.240
Guards!

29:12.599 --> 29:13.440
What are you doing?

29:13.960 --> 29:14.640
Sanniang!

29:14.839 --> 29:15.599
Let go of me!

29:15.680 --> 29:16.440
Miss Xie!

29:16.920 --> 29:17.680
Miss Xie!

29:17.680 --> 29:18.240
Let me go!

29:18.240 --> 29:18.960
Don't hurt her.

29:18.960 --> 29:19.519
Miss Xie!

29:21.599 --> 29:22.960
I don't care what you think of me.

29:23.240 --> 29:24.680
But a major battle is imminent.

29:24.839 --> 29:26.200
If Ganlin falls,

29:26.519 --> 29:28.839
it will descend into chaos instantly.

29:30.480 --> 29:31.480
Come back to the capital with me.

29:35.559 --> 29:36.480
During the sandstorm,

29:38.119 --> 29:39.480
you saved my life.

29:39.839 --> 29:40.799
So today,

29:42.359 --> 29:44.119
even if I have to use force,

29:44.119 --> 29:45.640
even if it goes against your wishes,

29:45.640 --> 29:47.279
I won't let you throw your life away.

29:50.720 --> 29:52.240
Shameless.

30:22.039 --> 30:22.839
Mr. Zhao.

30:23.440 --> 30:24.079
Mr. Zhao.

30:24.799 --> 30:26.480
The garrison's been busy
mustering troops these past two days.

30:27.000 --> 30:27.920
Security is thin.

30:29.279 --> 30:30.160
We should

30:30.519 --> 30:31.480
escape.

30:32.200 --> 30:32.920
Where's Miss Xie?

30:37.680 --> 30:39.279
She went to see Yu Jingxiu

30:39.680 --> 30:40.759
and still hasn't come back.

30:46.000 --> 30:46.720
Mr. Zhao,

30:47.440 --> 30:48.960
staying alive comes first.

30:48.960 --> 30:50.079
As long as we're alive...

30:50.920 --> 30:51.880
Where could we possibly run?

30:54.079 --> 30:55.240
When you're at the bottom,

30:56.519 --> 30:58.000
people can trample you
whenever they please.

30:59.359 --> 31:01.200
You can't even protect the people
you care about.

31:02.480 --> 31:03.119
Mr. Zhao.

31:05.160 --> 31:06.440
I was too eager for merit.

31:07.079 --> 31:08.200
I dragged all the men into this.

31:09.359 --> 31:09.960
You all go.

31:10.200 --> 31:10.839
I'll stay.

31:12.279 --> 31:12.960
I'm not leaving.

31:13.640 --> 31:14.359
Neither am I.

31:14.759 --> 31:16.160
But the charges have already
been decided.

31:16.319 --> 31:17.680
Even putting aside
how we clear our names,

31:18.000 --> 31:19.240
if we miss this campaign,

31:20.000 --> 31:21.640
will we ever get another chance?

31:22.240 --> 31:23.400
The horns haven't sounded.

31:24.279 --> 31:25.480
The war drums haven't beaten.

31:26.400 --> 31:28.279
As long as the army hasn't marched,

31:31.000 --> 31:32.519
we still have a chance.

31:51.760 --> 31:54.800
(Gandu Circuit Military Camp)

32:11.319 --> 32:11.880
Commander.

32:12.200 --> 32:13.599
Three more beacon fires
have lit up the north.

32:14.119 --> 32:15.160
The Wangur vanguard

32:15.160 --> 32:16.799
will reach the Black River before dawn.

32:17.480 --> 32:18.319
We can't delay any longer.

32:19.079 --> 32:20.400
The camp is in a panic.

32:20.599 --> 32:21.559
While making my rounds,

32:22.039 --> 32:23.079
I even heard men crying.

32:24.759 --> 32:26.799
Where did these bamboo slips come from?

32:26.799 --> 32:28.200
They were found in trenches
from the previous dynasty.

32:28.200 --> 32:29.519
Miss Xie restored some of them.

32:29.519 --> 32:30.759
Some were stored at the cavalry camp.

32:30.759 --> 32:31.319
These past few days,

32:31.319 --> 32:32.119
while preparing supplies,

32:32.119 --> 32:32.960
we came across them again.

33:00.839 --> 33:01.599
We're out of time.

33:02.160 --> 33:02.680
Hurry.

33:04.839 --> 33:05.279
Quick.

33:06.720 --> 33:07.359
Yucheng.

33:07.480 --> 33:08.079
Wait.

33:10.119 --> 33:10.680
Yucheng.

33:10.680 --> 33:11.160
What is it?

33:12.519 --> 33:13.400
Say something.

33:14.559 --> 33:15.359
Your mother

33:17.880 --> 33:20.039
fell ill last night and passed away.

33:36.519 --> 33:37.240
My mother...

33:40.359 --> 33:41.400
Did she leave any last words?

33:42.640 --> 33:43.559
She said...

33:47.839 --> 33:49.119
she wanted you to take care of yourself.

34:19.920 --> 34:20.800
Soldiers!

34:21.199 --> 34:23.039
The enemy beacons are already before us.

34:23.519 --> 34:25.920
I want to show you something.

34:26.960 --> 34:28.000
A hundred years ago,

34:28.440 --> 34:29.559
our people first

34:29.559 --> 34:30.920
took Ganlin back

34:30.920 --> 34:32.320
from the Wangur people.

34:32.880 --> 34:33.639
That battle

34:33.880 --> 34:35.960
lasted a full six months.

34:36.400 --> 34:37.239
And these are

34:37.639 --> 34:39.440
the final letters

34:39.599 --> 34:41.360
those soldiers left behind.

34:42.760 --> 34:44.320
If a young woman

34:44.320 --> 34:46.119
hadn't restored these bamboo slips,

34:46.599 --> 34:48.440
even I might have forgotten

34:48.440 --> 34:50.440
what we're fighting for.

34:51.480 --> 34:52.480
We fight

34:52.480 --> 34:54.920
to honor those recorded on bamboo slips,

34:55.440 --> 34:56.880
whose eyes have watched us
through the ages

34:57.199 --> 35:00.119
still hoping we defend
our homes and land!

35:00.719 --> 35:01.360
And now,

35:01.840 --> 35:03.719
the Wangur cavalry has returned,

35:05.159 --> 35:06.519
trampling

35:06.960 --> 35:10.159
the land our forefathers soaked
with their blood.

35:10.280 --> 35:11.599
What lies behind us?

35:12.079 --> 35:13.679
The gateway to the northwest.

35:13.840 --> 35:15.360
Thousands upon thousands of homes.

35:15.760 --> 35:17.400
And the spirits of every hero

35:17.719 --> 35:21.079
who has given his life on this land
over the past century!

35:21.480 --> 35:22.400
Soldiers!

35:22.599 --> 35:23.360
Yes, Commander!

35:23.360 --> 35:24.119
This battle

35:24.519 --> 35:26.679
isn't just about rank and glory.

35:27.039 --> 35:29.159
It's about carving your names

35:29.599 --> 35:31.280
deep into the hearts

35:31.440 --> 35:32.800
of generations to come.

35:33.159 --> 35:34.039
So they will know

35:34.840 --> 35:36.119
that a hundred years ago,

35:36.960 --> 35:38.639
someone held this ground.

35:39.119 --> 35:40.280
And a hundred years later,

35:40.800 --> 35:43.320
we will hold it again!

35:46.239 --> 35:49.079
We will not fail our forefathers!

35:49.079 --> 35:52.239
We will not fail our forefathers!

36:01.360 --> 36:01.880
Let's go!

36:02.440 --> 36:03.239
Take their heads

36:03.599 --> 36:04.519
and earn our merit!

36:05.280 --> 36:07.280
(Bandit Camp)

36:43.960 --> 36:46.159
Murder!

36:46.159 --> 36:46.920
Help!

36:47.599 --> 36:48.519
Murder!

37:02.480 --> 37:03.480
Wretch.

37:03.480 --> 37:04.440
What's all that noise?

37:07.760 --> 37:08.960
How am I supposed to sleep?

37:20.639 --> 37:22.360
They're all dead.

37:23.440 --> 37:24.159
Commander Zhao,

37:24.559 --> 37:25.880
please spare my life.

37:31.840 --> 37:32.519
Mr. Zhao,

37:33.000 --> 37:33.719
we've got

37:33.719 --> 37:34.519
15 in all.

37:34.880 --> 37:35.840
We're still one short.

37:37.400 --> 37:38.800
Even Heaven's against us.

37:45.719 --> 37:47.400
We're only short one head.

37:49.079 --> 37:49.920
That's easy enough.

37:51.519 --> 37:52.760
What do you mean, Yucheng?

37:54.119 --> 37:55.960
You want us to grab some villager
and kill him?

37:58.599 --> 37:59.920
Don't talk nonsense.

38:16.639 --> 38:18.800
(Your mother fell ill last night
and passed away.)

38:20.079 --> 38:20.800
(My mother...)

38:21.360 --> 38:22.360
(Did she leave any last words?)

38:23.239 --> 38:24.239
(She said...)

38:24.639 --> 38:25.920
(she wanted you to take care
of yourself.)

39:08.599 --> 39:09.559
Yucheng!

39:11.719 --> 39:12.639
Yucheng!

39:12.960 --> 39:16.639
- Yucheng!
- Yucheng!

39:16.639 --> 39:17.400
Yucheng!

39:18.199 --> 39:19.119
Yucheng!

39:20.760 --> 39:22.000
- Yucheng!
- Yucheng!

39:22.000 --> 39:22.960
Yucheng!

39:22.960 --> 39:23.880
Yucheng!

39:23.880 --> 39:24.519
Yucheng!

39:24.760 --> 39:25.880
Bro.

39:26.280 --> 39:26.960
No.

39:26.960 --> 39:27.880
The heads...

39:29.519 --> 39:30.760
you've got enough now.

39:32.480 --> 39:33.199
No.

39:33.920 --> 39:34.400
No.

39:35.599 --> 39:36.440
From now on,

39:37.280 --> 39:38.400
the road

39:39.119 --> 39:39.679
ahead...

39:41.920 --> 39:43.840
I can't walk it with you anymore.

39:44.719 --> 39:45.480
No.

39:48.360 --> 39:49.239
I'm too tired.

39:51.199 --> 39:52.159
I can't go any farther.

40:01.440 --> 40:03.000
Yucheng!

40:03.960 --> 40:07.599
- Yucheng!
- Yucheng!

40:10.320 --> 40:12.119
Yucheng!

40:15.320 --> 40:16.239
Why?

40:21.199 --> 40:22.039
Yucheng!

40:22.039 --> 40:23.079
Why?

40:25.199 --> 40:27.159
Yucheng!

40:32.480 --> 40:33.639
Why?

40:35.360 --> 40:37.239
Why?

40:37.440 --> 40:39.519
Yucheng!

40:40.239 --> 40:42.599
Yucheng!

40:45.880 --> 40:47.320
16 heads.

40:49.000 --> 40:50.000
Not one short.

40:50.400 --> 40:51.239
From now on,

40:55.639 --> 40:57.920
there won't be a single stain
on your record,

41:00.440 --> 41:02.440
and no one will be able
to threaten you with this again.

41:07.800 --> 41:10.559
You really are something.

41:11.440 --> 41:13.119
My wife was born into a great family

41:13.679 --> 41:15.119
and knows the art of dealing
with people.

41:16.400 --> 41:17.480
She always says a good gift

41:17.800 --> 41:19.039
is what someone needs,
not what's expensive,

41:20.239 --> 41:21.519
something rare, not something ordinary.

41:22.360 --> 41:23.719
So tell me, Commander,

41:26.199 --> 41:27.559
this gift before you...

41:30.679 --> 41:32.360
is it to your liking?

41:41.079 --> 41:42.000
Tell me.

41:42.519 --> 41:43.800
What do you want?

41:45.760 --> 41:46.719
A chance.

41:47.400 --> 41:49.960
And what do you think a chance is?

41:57.440 --> 41:58.280
Fairness.

41:58.880 --> 42:00.000
Fairness?

42:01.559 --> 42:04.320
Fairness means having
what everyone else has.

42:04.800 --> 42:06.800
A chance is something no one else has,

42:06.800 --> 42:08.800
something that's yours alone.

42:10.239 --> 42:11.760
That's why they say

42:11.880 --> 42:13.159
talent is easy to find,

42:13.159 --> 42:14.559
but opportunity is rare.

42:16.559 --> 42:17.719
Young man,

42:18.639 --> 42:20.800
think carefully and tell me.

42:21.119 --> 42:24.000
What is it you truly want?

42:26.519 --> 42:27.880
I want to make something of myself.

42:29.599 --> 42:30.920
I want to rise to the highest ranks.

42:32.199 --> 42:33.800
I want the people I care about

42:34.440 --> 42:36.039
never to be bullied or humiliated again.

42:41.119 --> 42:42.800
I want the brothers at my side

42:45.559 --> 42:47.440
never to die because of me again.

42:51.280 --> 42:52.880
If there is

42:54.079 --> 42:56.000
a road in this world that leads
all the way to the top,

42:58.800 --> 43:00.320
no matter how hard it is,

43:02.639 --> 43:05.159
I'll climb it one step at a time.

43:09.719 --> 43:11.519
Zhao Ling.

43:12.840 --> 43:14.880
Everything you've said is for yourself.

43:14.880 --> 43:16.360
Why should I help you?

43:17.840 --> 43:19.920
Let me answer that for you.

43:23.159 --> 43:24.360
In this world,

43:25.159 --> 43:28.639
few are born with Yu Jingxiu's
advantages.

43:30.440 --> 43:32.519
But there are countless people like you,
Zhao Ling...

43:33.559 --> 43:34.679
born with nothing,

43:34.679 --> 43:37.119
with no family or status behind them.

43:38.039 --> 43:40.159
Only when someone like you rises

43:40.239 --> 43:41.760
will those without privilege

43:41.760 --> 43:43.320
be less easily trampled.

43:43.320 --> 43:45.760
And only when men like you hold power

43:45.840 --> 43:47.559
will there be a little less injustice

43:48.039 --> 43:49.920
in this world.

43:56.039 --> 43:56.840
Am I right?

44:02.639 --> 44:03.400
Zhao Ling.

44:05.559 --> 44:07.639
I need a trusted man.

44:08.159 --> 44:09.519
One with ability

44:09.519 --> 44:11.400
and, more importantly, integrity.

44:11.719 --> 44:13.320
Your methods may be unconventional,

44:13.320 --> 44:15.360
but your purpose must be honorable.

44:30.079 --> 44:31.199
Commander,

44:31.880 --> 44:33.079
I, Zhao Ling,

44:33.840 --> 44:35.559
will serve as the army's vanguard

44:36.960 --> 44:38.400
and pledge my life in loyalty to you.

44:38.920 --> 44:39.840
Zhao Ling.

44:41.320 --> 44:43.480
With your character and ability...

44:44.800 --> 44:46.360
Give me five years.

44:47.440 --> 44:49.199
As long as you remain loyal to me,

44:49.480 --> 44:51.679
I'll see you rise through the ranks.

44:56.320 --> 44:57.760
Thank you, Commander.

44:58.760 --> 44:59.800
Pass down my orders!

45:00.480 --> 45:01.199
Zhao Ling

45:01.400 --> 45:02.599
is reinstated to his former post.

45:02.960 --> 45:04.960
He may enter my command tent
without prior notice.

45:05.360 --> 45:06.000
Effective immediately,

45:06.480 --> 45:07.920
he will march with the army!

45:10.639 --> 45:11.599
Yes, Commander.

45:21.520 --> 45:23.920
(Next Episode)

45:24.480 --> 45:25.760
Go find the Ninth Young Lady!

45:25.760 --> 45:26.400
Enough!

45:26.800 --> 45:28.199
Ever since you came to Ganlin,

45:28.239 --> 45:29.320
because of that woman,

45:29.400 --> 45:30.920
you've been completely out of sorts!

45:30.920 --> 45:32.679
Don't forget
we're your superior officers,

45:32.679 --> 45:33.639
not your fathers!

45:34.760 --> 45:37.719
You brought armed men and forced
your way into my residence today.

45:37.719 --> 45:40.039
You have no respect for the law.

45:40.159 --> 45:41.800
I'll petition the Emperor himself!

45:41.920 --> 45:43.159
Then you,

45:43.159 --> 45:46.000
that wretched woman
you haven't even married,

45:46.000 --> 45:47.639
- and all you
- (Zhao Ling!)

45:47.679 --> 45:49.960
northwestern mongrels

45:49.960 --> 45:51.840
will all come down with me.

46:06.520 --> 46:10.840
♪The past brushes by
like a falling leaf♪

46:14.440 --> 46:18.800
♪So light, yet my steps still pause
for you♪

46:20.920 --> 46:25.560
♪Through every rise and fall,
our memories remain without regret♪

46:25.800 --> 46:28.600
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

46:29.760 --> 46:34.400
♪How I wish I could stay
a little longer, but I can't♪

46:37.600 --> 46:44.440
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye will fill
my eyes with tears♪

46:45.320 --> 46:51.840
♪Etched deep within my heart,
yet buried without a word♪

46:52.800 --> 46:56.240
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

46:56.760 --> 47:00.960
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

47:01.240 --> 47:06.920
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

47:19.040 --> 47:22.920
♪For one fleeting moment, I found you
in the crowd♪

47:26.840 --> 47:30.840
♪Without a word, you lit up
half my life♪

47:32.560 --> 47:37.240
♪In silence, a love too deep for words♪

47:37.560 --> 47:40.240
♪Kept close within my heart♪

47:41.320 --> 47:46.160
♪From now on, no one else
is worth waiting for♪

47:49.680 --> 47:56.600
♪I turn away, afraid no one
will ever come home to me again♪

47:57.480 --> 48:03.960
♪If we can build our future together,
no storm can chill my heart♪

48:04.840 --> 48:08.360
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

48:08.800 --> 48:13.160
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

48:13.360 --> 48:19.080
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪
